      en: ["Largest HDB town in Northeast Singapore", "Name means 'river end' in Teochew (Aua Kang)", "Modern town development began in 1977", "Hougang Mall was officially opened in 1996", "Key location in Singapore's political history", "Punggol Park was opened to the public in 1992"],
